1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,403
Another promotion...

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,414
Mahadev... why is everyone getting ahead of me?

3
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:12,384
Who told you everyone has the same destination... and the same road?

4
00:00:12,834 --> 00:00:15,873
But honestly, it feels like I've been left behind.

5
00:00:16,323 --> 00:00:18,997
Even flowers bloom in different seasons.

6
00:00:19,947 --> 00:00:23,678
A flower that blooms late is no less beautiful.

7
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:27,622
So... I should just focus on my own journey?

8
00:00:27,842 --> 00:00:31,531
Yes. Don't measure your growth by someone else's timeline.

9
00:00:31,981 --> 00:00:35,300
Maybe late... but I'll bloom in my own time.
